{# When a question needs in-depth research, and how a plan runs. #}
In-depth research

A question with many independent parts or sources can benefit from a research plan.

The Deep Research option starts a planner. The person reviews the plan before it runs.
After the approval, one researcher runs each section of the plan, and the organizer
combines their reports into one answer.
